# Site Maps

#### A **sitemap** shows how webpages are organized and connected. It helps us see the big picture of how users move through a site. 
 

<img src="https://images.code.org/3c891d019252e0106b3979e97851f3be-image-1761147296181.png" alt="design process graph of the cycle" width="550px" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">



#### Your students will create a sitemap and trace user flow using sketch lab  and then use AI to build a quick app based on their flow. 


